        "TileImage": "$($repository b13314ab-ea25-48b7-9e51-8ebb87788e20).Image",
        "Description": "47, we’re sending you back to Hokkaido to deliver a fatal blow to Japan’s largest Organ Harvesting Ring. Our client would like you to make a statement, and to ensure that those who remain are forever in fear for their lives. \r\rThese are despicable people 47. Make them understand that for their actions, they will reap what they sow. \r\rGood luck",
